WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.643
How should the Centre and

2
00:00:01.643 --> 00:00:03.107
the states get along?

3
00:00:03.107 --> 00:00:05.401
Two commissions tried to answer.

4
00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.795
The Sarkaria Commission was set

5
00:00:08.795 --> 00:00:11.150
up in 1983 and reported

6
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.289
in 1988.

7
00:00:12.289 --> 00:00:14.920
The Punchhi Commission came in

8
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.919
2007, and reported in 2010.

9
00:00:18.254 --> 00:00:21.174
Sarkaria said Article 356 should

10
00:00:21.174 --> 00:00:23.077
be a last resort.

11
00:00:23.077 --> 00:00:24.911
It also led to the

12
00:00:24.911 --> 00:00:26.831
Inter-State Council,

13
00:00:26.831 --> 00:00:28.836
set up in 1990 under

14
00:00:28.836 --> 00:00:30.515
Article 263.

15
00:00:30.846 --> 00:00:34.065
Both pushed towards cooperative federalism.

16
00:00:34.065 --> 00:00:35.702
The Centre and the states

17
00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.592
as partners,

18
00:00:36.592 --> 00:00:37.847
not rivals.

19
00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:39.802
Your turn.

20
00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:41.708
Under which Article?
